      "duration_sec": 9.83,
      "audio_start_sec": 71.19,
      "audio_end_sec": 81.02,
      "text": "The restaurant prepares the very best dishes to offer to the monastery, and every dish has to be perfect, like these savory dumplings known as moneybags. So that's a moneybag. And that's it."
