      "end_sec": 125.1,
      "duration_sec": 15.06,
      "audio_start_sec": 110.04,
      "audio_end_sec": 125.1,
      "text": "Chang's authentic moneybags are delicious, but I want to show him my take on a classic, Thailand's national dish, pad Thai. Okay, a quick pad Thai. I fry shallots, garlic, and chili with salt and a little bit of sugar. Color on the shallots."
    },
    {
