      "duration_sec": 8.72,
      "audio_start_sec": 167.24,
      "audio_end_sec": 175.96,
      "text": "Prawns and fresh coriander finish the pad Thai. But what will Chang think of my quick and easy version of this classic? And then some peanuts around the outside. Happy? Oh, no."
